    <bpmn:process id="W_W1460" name="W1460. Customer-Facing Project Guide &amp; DIY Tutorial Content Management &amp; Publishing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly content calendar milestone; new product category launch; customer service feedback; seasonal trigger per Section 13.2
Frequency: Content creation: 8–12 new guides/quarter; Content review: quarterly; Publishing: as-ready
Volume: ~50–80 active project guides maintained; ~200,000–300,000 guide views/month across website and app
Owner: Content Marketing Specialist
Participants: Content Marketing Specialist, Category Manager (reviewer), Store Operations (reviewer), Ecommerce Team, Social Commerce Specialist, Marketing Data Analyst
Source: workflow W1460 — Customer-Facing Project Guide &amp; DIY Tutorial Content Management &amp; Publishing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1460_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1460_Lane1" name="Content Marketing Specialist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1460_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1460_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
