    <bpmn:process id="W_W1484" name="W1484. Employee Onboarding Knowledge Path, Role-Based Training Curriculum &amp; Competency Assessment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New employee onboarding per W19.1; employee role change; or annual competency reassessment cycle
Frequency: ~1,200–1,600 new hires/year (turnover replacement + growth); annual competency reassessment for all 6,932 employees
Volume: ~1,400 new hire training paths/year + 6,932 annual reassessments; 8 role-based curricula covering store, DC, and HQ roles
Owner: HR Training Manager
Participants: HR Training Manager, Department Supervisor, Store Manager, Department Head (HQ), LMS Administrator, New Employee
Source: workflow W1484 — Employee Onboarding Knowledge Path, Role-Based Training Curriculum &amp; Competency Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1484_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1484_Lane1" name="HR Training Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1484_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1484_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
